🎯 Learning Outcomes
After using this application, users will be able to:

Recognize common cybersecurity threats (phishing, scams, malware)

Implement password security best practices (strong passwords, 2FA)

Protect personal privacy across digital platforms

Identify suspicious emails and messages

Understand the importance of regular backups

Use voice commands for hands-free learning

Navigate an intuitive GUI application

🔐 Security Notice
This application:

Does NOT collect any user data externally

Does NOT transmit any information over the network

Stores memory only during the current session

Uses local speech recognition (no cloud processing)
